  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "創生創新與永續發展",
    "sub_ename": "REVITALIZATION INNOVATION AND SDGS",
    "describe_ch": "地方創生已成為跨域顯學，永續發展(SDGs)更是全球共通目標。本課程從聯合國提出SDGs的17大目標，做為討論地方發展的事務的基礎，與如何以創新方法與工具實踐永續發展的行動。實際操作時涵括上述目標中的工作與經濟成長、創新與基礎建設、良好健康與福祉、優質教育、永續鄉鎮、及其他重要議題與領域。",
    "describe_eh": "Local revitalization has become major issue while sustainable development goals are common missions for global countries. Under 17 goals set by the UN, the class would address innovative development actions regarding to local revitalization. The course will introduce multi fields, including decent work and economic growth, innovation and infrastructure, good health and wellbeing, quality education, sustainable cities and communities, and other important issues.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
